class DetectorStreams {
    +calculate(name, parameters, identities, times, values)
    +max_points : int
    +max_streams : int
}
LiveRuntime ..> WindowStore : same replay with persistent streams
ReplayRuntime ..> Detector : via replay and unary/correlation
ReplayRuntime ..> RuntimeTrendDetector : timestamp adapter
LiveRuntime ..> Detector : via replay and unary/correlation
